(🇬🇧&amp;🇹🇷)

I realized it’s been a while since I shared a </span><a class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-brand text-[length:inherit] font-inherit hover:underline" href="https://x.com/hashtag/BTC">#BTC</a><span class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-inherit text-[length:inherit] font-inherit"> analysis outside of the research reports.

In interim posts (like the one quoted) and in the </span><a class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-brand text-[length:inherit] font-normal hover:underline" href="https://x.com/OKXTurkiye">@<!-- -->OKXTurkiye</a><span class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-inherit text-[length:inherit] font-inherit"> Research Report, I usually provide insight into my bias but I wanted to leave a more structured update here as well.
Relevant notes are marked directly on the chart.

Key short-term levels I’m watching:
As long as $110,400 holds, I have little concern regarding my LTF positions.
The $114,350 level may act as resistance.
Another critical zone is around $117,000, which I’ve previously flagged as the 4H demand zone. Losing this area could be problematic.

You can also see my sample entries along with the warning I shared when price was just above the green box in the attached position examples.

Note: In the 3rd screenshot, you’ll notice some frequent position openings/closings. This is because I’m currently in a trading competition. With limited time and the responsibility of supporting the team’s performance, profit-taking becomes a necessity.

Wishing you all a great day and success in your trades!
-------------
</span><a data-state="closed" data-slot="hover-card-trigger" class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-brand text-[length:inherit] font-normal hover:underline" href="https://x.com/search?q=$BTC">$<!-- -->BTC</a><span class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-inherit text-[length:inherit] font-inherit"> | LTF Güncelleme

Uzun süredir araştırma raporu dışında burada </span><a class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-brand text-[length:inherit] font-inherit hover:underline" href="https://x.com/hashtag/BTC">#BTC</a><span class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-inherit text-[length:inherit] font-inherit"> analizlerimi paylaşmadığımı farkettim.

Alıntıladığım mesaj gibi olan ara post&#x27;larda ve </span><a class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-brand text-[length:inherit] font-normal hover:underline" href="https://x.com/OKXTurkiye">@<!-- -->OKXTurkiye</a><span class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-inherit text-[length:inherit] font-inherit"> Araştırma Raporu&#x27;nda öngörüm hakkında bilgi vermeye çalışıyorum ancak derli toplu şekilde genel bir güncelleme olarak kalsın.
 İlgili notlar grafik üzerindedir.

Kısa vadede önemsediğim bölgeler:
Şu aşamada $110.400 bölgesi kaybedilmedikçe LTF pozisyonlarım hakkında pek bir endişem yok.
$114.350 bölgesi direnç olarak görev üstlenebilir. 
Bir diğer problemli alan ise daha öncesinde kaybının tatsız olacağını vurguladığım 4H Talep Alanının olduğu bölge olan $117.000 civarlarıdır.

Örnek alımlarımı ve fiyat yeşil kutunun hemen üstündeyken yaptığım uyarıya binaen alımımı ekteki pozisyon örneklerinde bulabilirsiniz.

Not: 3. ss&#x27;de pozisyonlarımı açıp kapatmamın sebebi yarışmada olmamdan ötürüdür. Orada sınırlı bir zaman olduğu ve takımın bekasını da düşünmek gerektiği için kâr realizasyonu şart hale geliyor.

Herkese güzel bir gün ve trade’lerinde başarılar dilerim.</span></div><div class="relative"><div class="aspect-[25/17] overflow-hidden"><div class="scrollbar-hide flex h-full min-h-0 snap-x snap-mandatory gap-2 overflow-x-auto [&amp;::-webkit-scrollbar]:hidden"><div class="h-full min-h-0 w-[85%] shrink-0 snap-center overflow-hidden rounded-md border border-gray-200"><div class="relative h-full w-full"><div inert="" class="h-full w-full"><a aria-label="Image" class="block h-full w-full cursor-zoom-in appearance-none border-none bg-transparent p-0 text-inherit" href="/Efloud/status/1965357070011486635/photo/1"><img alt="" class="h-full w-full object-cover" loading="eager" fetchPriority="high" width="3286" height="1770" src="https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G0ZXt4IWAAA68hE?format=webp&amp;name=medium" srcSet="https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G0ZXt4IWAAA68hE?format=webp&amp;name=small 680w, https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G0ZXt4IWAAA68hE?format=webp&amp;name=medium 1200w, https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G0ZXt4IWAAA68hE?format=webp&amp;name=large 2048w" sizes="(max-width: 600px) calc(100vw - 80px), 600px"/></a></div><a aria-label="View media" class="absolute inset-0 z-10" href="/Efloud/status/1965357070011486635/photo/1"></a></div></div><div class="h-full min-h-0 w-[85%] shrink-0 snap-center overflow-hidden rounded-md border border-gray-200"><div class="relative h-full w-full"><div inert="" class="h-full w-full"><a aria-label="Image" class="block h-full w-full cursor-zoom-in appearance-none border-none bg-transparent p-0 text-inherit" href="/Efloud/status/1965357070011486635/photo/2"><img alt="" class="h-full w-full object-cover" loading="lazy" width="2104" height="750" src="https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G0ZXwDpXQAAvTwy?format=webp&amp;name=medium" srcSet="https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G0ZXwDpXQAAvTwy?format=webp&amp;name=small 680w, https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G0ZXwDpXQAAvTwy?format=webp&amp;name=medium 1200w, https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G0ZXwDpXQAAvTwy?format=webp&amp;name=large 2048w" size